.TH stralloc_utf8_latin1 3 "Version 1.0" "December 2023" "lib/ucs"
.SH NAME
stralloc_utf8_latin1 \- Convert a UTF-8 string in a stralloc to a Latin-1 string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <lib/stralloc.h>
.B #include <lib/ucs.h>
.sp
.BI "size_t stralloc_utf8_latin1(stralloc* sa)"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The function .BR stralloc_utf8_latin1 () converts a UTF-8 string in a stralloc to a Latin-1 string in place. The function takes the following parameter:
.sp
1. A pointer to a stralloc containing the UTF-8 string.
.sp
The function returns the number of bytes in the Latin-1 string.
.SH RETURN VALUE
The number of bytes in the Latin-1 string.
.SH EXAMPLES
No examples are provided for this function.
.SH SEE ALSO
.B stralloc, scan_latin1_utf8
